Hi {Owner},

I build websites for carpet and upholstery cleaners around {City}. {Business Name} has great before-and-after work on social media, but someone with a fresh stain tonight can't see a price or book a time.

I built a sample first instead of asking for your time: prices per room and per sofa, a pet odour page, rug pickup booking and answers about drying time, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
